    "萤传 · 隐私政策" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen · Privacy Policy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "萤传是一款基于 cimbar 动态彩色码协议的离线文件接收工具。通过摄像头扫描发送端屏幕的动画码完成文件传输，无需网络、无需配对。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen is an offline file receiver built on the cimbar animated color-code protocol. Scan the animated code on the sender's screen with your camera to transfer files — no network, no pairing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码完成: %@" : {
