    },
    "解码模式需与发送端一致，cimbar.org 当前默认为标准 Mode B；切换模式会重置正在进行的扫码。1080p 采集可提高远距/大屏识别率，但更耗电。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The decode mode must match the sender's — cimbar.org currently defaults to standard Mode B. Switching modes resets any scan in progress. 1080p capture improves recognition at longer distances and on large screens, but uses more battery."
