    "您接收到的文件内容" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The content of files you receive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**相机权限（必需）**：仅用于扫描发送端的彩色动画码。该权限只在「扫码」页激活时使用，画面仅在本机内存中实时解码，不会被存储或上传。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Camera (required):** used only to scan the sender's animated color code, and only while the Scan tab is active. Frames are decoded in memory on the device and are never stored or uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**相册写入权限（可选）**：仅在您主动选择将接收到的图片保存到相册时使用。本应用不读取您相册中的任何内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Add to Photos (optional):** used only when you choose to save a received image to your photo library. The app never reads anything in your library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅保存在您本机设备上，不会被上传或同步到任何云端" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stay on your device only and are never uploaded or synced to any cloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可在系统「文件」App 中浏览" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can be browsed in the Files app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "您可随时在应用内手动删除，或在「设置 → 保留策略」中配置自动清理规则" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can be deleted in the app at any time, or cleaned up automatically under Settings → File Retention"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载本应用时，这些文件会随应用一并删除" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Are deleted together with the app when you delete it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "彩色动画码在屏幕上完整可见，附近的人可拍摄、录屏甚至远距离捕获" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The animated code is fully visible on screen; people nearby can photograph, record or capture it, even from a distance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**请勿用于传输商业机密、个人隐私文件等敏感内容**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
